{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34765","headline":"和皮日休悼鹤 一 · 魏朴","name":"和皮日休悼鹤 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直欲裁诗问杳冥，岂教灵化亦浮生。\n风林月动疑留魄，沙岛香愁似蕴情。\n雪骨夜封苍藓冷，练衣寒在碧塘轻。\n人间飞去犹堪恨，况是泉台远玉京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏朴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}